  "notes": [
    "The baked contract is the operational profile only; release status, image digest, and per-mode validation references live in the distribution package release.json.",
    "VLLM_SM120_GRAPH_VALIDATION_DIR makes mtp3-graph self-check its CUDA graph resolution at startup when set; it is NOT set in the released profile — the validated Graph006 configuration did not enable it, and the forward-recording path it activates was never GPU qualified.",
    "The mtp3-graph environment matches the GPU-validated candidate-006 runtime exactly (telemetry-only recording gates omitted; the hard-required VLLM_SM120_MTP_GRAPH_EVIDENCE_DIR is kept).",
    "VLLM_EXECUTE_MODEL_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=900: with a cold FlashInfer autotune cache, the first plan at each large prefill length (196K/262K) runs a tuning sweep that exceeds the default 300s RPC deadline; 900s bounds it safely. This was found by the staged 196K gate and is required, not cosmetic.",
    "NVFP4 KV requires VLLM_KV_CACHE_LAYOUT=HND; the engine refuses to boot otherwise.",
    "Telemetry-recording gates used during the internal campaign are intentionally omitted from the public profile."
  ]
